  "book": {
    "book_usfm": "PRO",
    "name": "Proverbs"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "usfm": "PRO.23",
    "human": "Proverbs 23",
    "previous": {
      "usfm": "PRO.22",
      "human": "Proverbs 22"
    },
    "next": {
      "usfm": "PRO.24",
      "human": "Proverbs 24"
    },
    "items": [
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "When you sit down to dine with a ruler,",
          "consider carefully what is before you,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "and put a knife to your throat",
          "if you have a big appetite;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "don’t desire his choice food,",
          "for that food is deceptive."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Don’t wear yourself out to get rich;",
          "because you know better, stop!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "As soon as your eyes fly to it, it disappears,",
          "for it makes wings for itself",
          "and flies like an eagle to the sky."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Don’t eat a stingy person’s bread, ,",
          "and don’t desire his choice food,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "for it’s like someone calculating inwardly. ,",
          "“Eat and drink,” he says to you,",
          "but his heart is not with you."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "You will vomit the little you’ve eaten",
          "and waste your pleasant words."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Don’t speak to a fool,",
          "for he will despise the insight of your words."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Don’t move an ancient boundary marker,",
          "and don’t encroach on the fields of the fatherless,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "for their Redeemer is strong,",
          "and he will champion their cause against you."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Apply yourself to discipline",
          "and listen to words of knowledge."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Don’t withhold discipline from a youth;",
          "if you punish him with a rod, he will not die."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Punish him with a rod,",
          "and you will rescue his life from Sheol."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "My son, if your heart is wise,",
          "my heart will indeed rejoice."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "My innermost being will celebrate",
          "when your lips say what is right."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Don’t let your heart envy sinners;",
          "instead, always fear the Lord."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          18
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For then you will have a future,",
          "and your hope will not be dashed."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Listen, my son, and be wise;",
          "keep your mind on the right course."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          20
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Don’t associate with those who drink too much wine",
          "or with those who gorge themselves on meat."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          21
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For the drunkard and the glutton will become poor,",
          "and grogginess will clothe them in rags."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          22
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Listen to your father who gave you life,",
          "and don’t despise your mother when she is old."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          23
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Buy #— #and do not sell #— #truth,",
          "wisdom, instruction, and understanding."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          24
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The father of a righteous son will rejoice greatly,",
          "and one who fathers a wise son will delight in him."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          25
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Let your father and mother have joy,",
          "and let her who gave birth to you rejoice."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          26
        ],
        "lines": [
          "My son, give me your heart,",
          "and let your eyes observe my ways."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          27
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For a prostitute is a deep pit,",
          "and a wayward woman is a narrow well;"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          28
        ],
        "lines": [
          "indeed, she sets an ambush like a robber",
          "and increases the number of unfaithful people."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          29
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Who has woe? Who has sorrow?",
          "Who has conflicts? Who has complaints?",
          "Who has wounds for no reason?",
          "Who has red eyes?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          30
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Those who linger over wine;",
          "those who go looking for mixed wine."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          31
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Don’t gaze at wine because it is red,",
          "because it gleams in the cup",
          "and goes down smoothly."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          32
        ],
        "lines": [
          "In the end it bites like a snake",
          "and stings like a viper."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          33
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Your eyes will see strange things,",
          "and you will say absurd things. ,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          34
        ],
        "lines": [
          "You’ll be like someone sleeping out at sea",
          "or lying down on the top of a ship’s mast."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          35
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“They struck me, but I feel no pain!",
          "They beat me, but I didn’t know it!",
          "When will I wake up?",
          "I’ll look for another drink.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
